Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Pods Not Starting
Symptoms: Pods stuck in Pending or CrashLoopBackOff state

Solutions:

# Check pod events
oc describe pod <pod-name>

# Check resource availability
oc describe nodes

# Verify image pull
oc logs <pod-name>
Issue 2: HPA Not Scaling
Symptoms: HPA shows <unknown> for metrics

Solutions:

# Check metrics server
oc get pods -n openshift-monitoring

# Verify resource requests are set
oc describe deployment camel-routes

# Check HPA events
oc describe hpa camel-routes-hpa
Issue 3: Application Not Responding
Symptoms: Curl requests timeout or return errors

Solutions:

# Check service endpoints
oc get endpoints camel-routes-service

# Verify route configuration
oc describe route camel-routes-route

# Check application logs
oc logs -l app=camel-routes --tail=100
Issue 4: Memory or CPU Issues
Symptoms: Pods getting killed or restarted frequently

Solutions:

# Check resource usage
oc top pods -l app=camel-routes

# Adjust resource limits
oc patch deployment camel-routes -p '{
  "spec": {
    "template": {
      "spec": {
        "containers": [{
          "name": "camel-routes",
          "resources": {
            "limits": {
              "memory": "1Gi",
              "cpu": "1000m"
            }
          }
        }]
      }
    }
  }
}'
